    values:originalText "(3) In making a determination under subsection (1), the Commission:  (a) must have regard to:  (i) the likely benefit to the public resulting from the assistance, or likely assistance, in response to or recovery from the exceptional circumstances to which the declaration relates; and  (ii) the detriment to the public that would result, or be likely to result, from the conduct; and  (b) may have regard to any other public benefit that would result or likely result from the conduct." ;
