concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-responding-to-exceptional-circumstances-act-2026-sch-1-sec-95ae a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "95AE Minister may declare exceptional circumstances"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-95ae ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, make a declaration under this section if the Minister is satisfied that:  (a) either:  (i) exceptional circumstances that are causing significant harm to the Australian economy or Australian consumers exist; or  (ii) exceptional circumstances that would cause significant harm to the Australian economy or Australian consumers are likely to exist; and  (b) it is in the public interest to empower the Commission to make determinations under either or both of the following:  (i) section 92D;  (ii) section 95AC.  (2) A declaration under subsection (1) is in force for the period:  Schedule 1  Exceptional circumstances exemption powers" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, make a declaration under this section if the Minister is satisfied that:  (a) either:  (i) exceptional circumstances that are causing significant harm to the Australian economy or Australian consumers exist; or  (ii) exceptional circumstances that would cause significant harm to the Australian economy or Australian consumers are likely to exist; and  (b) it is in the public interest to empower the Commission to make determinations under either or both of the following:  (i) section 92D;  (ii) section 95AC.  (2) A declaration under subsection (1) is in force for the period:  Schedule 1  Exceptional circumstances exemption powers"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "4e91ea80188855fa8e0ae8dbe9025a4e6a7bad39c18594aaed96080e543fb8da" ;
    cof:pageNumber "15"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-responding-to-exceptional-circumstances-act-2026-sch-1-sec-95ae-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-responding-to-exceptional-circumstances-act-2026-sch-1-sec-95ae-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
