concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-responding-to-exceptional-circumstances-act-2026-sch-2-sec-1 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "1 Subsection 51ACF(2)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-1 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the subsection, substitute: Industry codes relating to food and groceries, or oil  (2) This subsection applies to an industry code that:  (a) relates to:  (i) food and groceries; or  (ii) the conduct of suppliers, distributors and retailers in the petroleum marketing industry; and  (b) provides that this subsection applies to the code." ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the subsection, substitute: Industry codes relating to food and groceries, or oil  (2) This subsection applies to an industry code that:  (a) relates to:  (i) food and groceries; or  (ii) the conduct of suppliers, distributors and retailers in the petroleum marketing industry; and  (b) provides that this subsection applies to the code."@en ;
